  "family": "global",
  "lineage": "Festive brass-and-percussion bands of the Landes, Gers, Béarn and French Basque Country that play in the streets and arenas at férias, bullfights, rugby matches and village fêtes. Bands in matching costume play pasodobles, marches and popular tunes taken up by the crowd, a repertoire drawing heavily on the Spanish pasodoble, and many gather each year at the festival of bandas in Condom, documented in the INA regional archive.",
